      "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"group\"><h4>Questions 20 and 21</h4><p>Choose TWO correct answers.</p><p>In which TWO of the following sea creatures does one gender attract the other using light?</p><div class=\"options\"><label class=\"mc-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q7-q8\" value=\"A\"> <span>A. swordfish</span></label><label class=\"mc-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q7-q8\" value=\"B\"> <span>B. box jellyfish</span></label><label class=\"mc-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q7-q8\" value=\"C\"> <span>C. mantis shrimp</span></label><label class=\"mc-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q7-q8\" value=\"D\"> <span>D. anglerfish</span></label><label class=\"mc-option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"q7-q8\" value=\"E\"> <span>E. atolla jellyfish</span></label></div></div>",
